1
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:03,133
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:03,133 --> 00:00:04,667
I hate you!

3
00:00:04,667 --> 00:00:07,233
You ruined my family!

4
00:00:07,233 --> 00:00:09,667
(In Korean)
Enough! Brenda, enough!

5
00:00:10,367 --> 00:00:11,700
Enough!

6
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:18,633
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

7
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,200
I apologize for my daughter.

8
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,167
I'm sorry, Hannah.

9
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:38,000
[MUSIC BECOMES SOFT]

10
00:00:38,033 --> 00:00:39,567
Stop! Both of you!

11
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:44,100
This time,
you went too far!

12
00:00:44,733 --> 00:00:48,600
You must be accountable
for tampering with documents.

13
00:00:49,267 --> 00:00:50,433
No!

14
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:53,300
I have to teach you both
a lesson.

15
00:00:54,133 --> 00:00:55,533
Take them to the police!

16
00:00:56,667 --> 00:00:58,467
- [SELENA] (In Korean) No...
- Do it!

17
00:00:59,733 --> 00:01:02,100
Dad, please!

18
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:03,800
Dad!

19
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,300
- [SELANA SCREAMING IN ANGER]
- [BRENDA CRYING]

20
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:10,267
Dad, please!

21
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:12,433
Don't do this!

22
00:01:12,433 --> 00:01:13,767
[SELENA] Min-jae!

23
00:01:13,767 --> 00:01:16,767
Not your daughter!

24
00:01:16,767 --> 00:01:19,133
You should've punished me,

25
00:01:19,133 --> 00:01:20,567
not Hannah.

26
00:01:20,567 --> 00:01:24,100
She has done nothing wrong.

27
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:27,400
And she deserves to be
part of our family.

28
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,133
Let me go!

29
00:01:33,233 --> 00:01:34,533
[GRUNTS]

30
00:01:34,533 --> 00:01:41,133
[MUSIC BUILDS]

31
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:50,600
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

32
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:53,233
Punish me instead.

33
00:01:55,367 --> 00:01:57,733
Just please let my mom
go back to Korea.

34
00:01:57,733 --> 00:01:59,367
Please.

35
00:01:59,367 --> 00:02:00,433
I'm begging you.

36
00:02:00,433 --> 00:02:02,600
[BREATHING SHAKILY]

37
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,700
I'm begging you, please!

38
00:02:07,700 --> 00:02:14,600
[DRAMATIC MUSIC CONTINUES]
